vox-fuzz 0.2.0
version exits clean: 1
usage: vox-fuzz <command> [options]

commands:
  gen        generate, compile, and run random Vox programs
  version    print the version

gen options:
  --seed N       first seed (default 1)
  --count N      how many programs (default 100)
  --budget N     statements per program (default 12)
  --timeout MILLISECONDS per-program time limit (default 10000)
  --vox PATH     vox binary (default ../vox/target/release/vox)
  --core DIR     coreasm dir (default ../vox/coreasm)
  --out DIR      findings directory (default ./findings)
  --keep DIR     also save every generated program here (default: off)
  --layout MODE  random (default) or plain: whether a program's whitespace is drawn or laid out one statement per line
bad subcommand exits 2: 1
vox-fuzz gen: seeds 500.. count 3 budget 12 timeout 10000ms
programs: 3
compiled: 3
findings: 0
gen runs: 1
